<p>Cutter 1-2 350#/up				  68.00 B</p>
<p>Bulls YG 1 500#/up				  unq</p>
<p>BONELESS PROCESSING BEEF/BEEF TRIMMINGS </p>
<p>36.0  Loads Reported. Lean boneless beef</p>
<p>mostly $3.00 higher; 85% 4.00 higher; 75%</p>
<p>generally steady; 65% steady to firm. Demand and offerings light</p>
<p>to moderate. Beef trimmings generally steady on light demand and</p>
<p>offerings.</p>
